%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: NPCDialogue_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0f91960a2d90aa5468602ee1b60721d5, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 104222408704
    m_Localized: Next
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104302100480
    m_Localized: Miso
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294784
    m_Localized: "(\uD50C\uB808\uC774\uC5B4 \uC774\uB984), I heard you took over
      Grandma Deunhae's shop!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294785
    m_Localized: It feels like you were learning from her just yesterday. Now you've
      got a shop of your own! I wanted to hear how it was going.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294786
    m_Localized: I'm counting on you, too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294787
    m_Localized: Come by the shop sometime.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294788
    m_Localized: Of course. If anyone asks about your shop, I'll point them your
      way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294789
    m_Localized: Great. Hehe, I suppose the place will start looking a little more
      like you now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294790
    m_Localized: "Oh, (\uD50C\uB808\uC774\uC5B4 \uC774\uB984)! There's something
      I wanted to ask you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294791
    m_Localized: There you are! Got a moment to talk?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294792
    m_Localized: Where are you headed? If you're not in a hurry, stay a minute.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294793
    m_Localized: Everyday life
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294794
    m_Localized: Other rabbits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294795
    m_Localized: Old stories
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294796
    m_Localized: It's so quiet outside the store lately.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294797
    m_Localized: We used to stop for a chat, and someone else would always join in.
      Now everyone just says hello and leaves.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294798
    m_Localized: It's been bothering you, too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294799
    m_Localized: Why don't you start a conversation?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294800
    m_Localized: Yeah. I think it's been like this since the Moon Tree started withering.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294801
    m_Localized: It's not that there's nothing to say. Whatever we talk about ends
      up turning into another worry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294802
    m_Localized: Aw, but if it's quiet all the time, things get boring!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294803
    m_Localized: Sometimes you need a big burst of laughter to make the village feel
      alive!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294804
    m_Localized: Do you think alien customers from other worlds like how chewy rice
      cakes are?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294805
    m_Localized: That's my favorite part. It's a little disappointing when a bite
      is gone right away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294806
    m_Localized: I prefer something crunchy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294807
    m_Localized: It probably depends on the customer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294808
    m_Localized: Oh, then we'd pick different things from the same plate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294809
    m_Localized: I'll have to see what you choose. I always end up eating my usual
      favorites.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294810
    m_Localized: I like things that are sweet and chewy!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294811
    m_Localized: You know, the kind that cheers you up in one bite! I bet the aliens
      would love treats like that too!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294812
    m_Localized: Have you seen the Moon Tree? It's a little brighter between the
      leaves!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294813
    m_Localized: I asked a rabbit standing beside me. They saw it, too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294814
    m_Localized: The starlight I collected must have helped.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294815
    m_Localized: Yeah, I thought it might be thanks to your starlight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294816
    m_Localized: It's been a while since I had good news to share. It feels nice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294817
    m_Localized: ...Or am I imagining that part?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294818
    m_Localized: An alien customer was talking about your shop. They mentioned you
      before they even named the treats.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294819
    m_Localized: 'But last night, I saw him secretly buying

      a whole bunch
      of warmed-up honey tteok.

      Isn''t that hilarious?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294820
    m_Localized: What did I do?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294821
    m_Localized: I hope it was something good.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294822
    m_Localized: They said you turned the plate a little before serving it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294823
    m_Localized: Like you were deciding which side looked nicest. That must have
      stuck with them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294824
    m_Localized: "Hehe, I'm the neighborhood news expert!\nMy ears are magical\u2014they
      soak up\nevery bit of gossip in the village."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294825
    m_Localized: 'If there''s ever anything you want to know,

      just ask me,
      Boss!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294826
    m_Localized: An alien customer from another world was looking for your shop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294827
    m_Localized: They went to a lot of trouble to get here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294828
    m_Localized: Yeah. They asked if there would be any treats left, so I sent them
      over.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294829
    m_Localized: I wonder if they made it. They came all this way to try your food.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294830
    m_Localized: It takes ages to tell Maru even one little rumor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294831
    m_Localized: Who saw it, when I heard it... He keeps asking, and I end up starting
      the story all over again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294832
    m_Localized: Seriously, take studying away and there's nothing left of him!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294833
    m_Localized: At least there'll be fewer mistakes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294834
    m_Localized: But you still keep him informed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294835
    m_Localized: ...That's true. I have misheard things before.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294836
    m_Localized: These days I tell him up front if I didn't see it myself. He asks
      a little less that way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294837
    m_Localized: 'Close? No way! Ugh, you''re giving me chills!

      We just grew
      up together, so I have no choice but to look after him.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294838
    m_Localized: 'Ahem, you know what it was like.

      Even when the three of
      us played in the dirt as kids,

      he''d be off polishing his glasses by
      himself.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294839
    m_Localized: 'Oh, there I go talking about the old days again.

      Okay, stop
      looking at me like that. Next topic!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294840
    m_Localized: I was giving an alien customer directions and called your place
      "Grandma Deunhae's shop" without thinking.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294841
    m_Localized: They asked who Grandma was. Of course they didn't know. It was their
      first visit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294842
    m_Localized: I'm used to the old name, too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294843
    m_Localized: Did you tell them my name?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294844
    m_Localized: Right? We often call shops by the rabbit who runs them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294845
    m_Localized: 'Exactly! We owe it all to those engineer rabbits!

      I don''t
      know how our parents lived without any light.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294846
    m_Localized: Aunt Somi remembers what a customer said, and Uncle Garam remembers
      what they bought.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294847
    m_Localized: You have to put their stories together to get the whole day!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294848
    m_Localized: Then I should listen to them together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294849
    m_Localized: Garam scares me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294850
    m_Localized: Yeah. Aunt Somi looks over at him while she's talking, and he fills
      in a little piece.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294851
    m_Localized: They remember different things. It's actually quite fun to listen
      to.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294852
    m_Localized: 'Puhaha!

      Uncle Garam is pretty blunt, isn''t he?

      But
      did you know this?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294853
    m_Localized: 'When you first said you were opening the tea shop,

      Uncle
      Garam asked Aunt Somi

      to find you good, hot-burning firewood

      so
      you wouldn''t burn your hands.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294854
    m_Localized: 'Don''t be scared.

      Uncle Garam is just bad at showing how
      he feels!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294855
    m_Localized: Alien customers aren't just asking about your shop anymore.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294856
    m_Localized: Where did you send them?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294857
    m_Localized: Sounds like they can take their time now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294858
    m_Localized: They were curious about the ingredients, so I suggested the mill.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294859
    m_Localized: They wanted to see rice cakes being pounded. We know that sound
      by heart, but it seems they'd never seen it before.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294860
    m_Localized: Right? Seeing the village come alive thanks to you puts me in a
      great mood too!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294861
    m_Localized: I found an old wrapper in storage. An alien customer wrote the name
      of a treat on it in their own world's script.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294862
    m_Localized: Ask them if they come back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294863
    m_Localized: You've kept it all this time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294864
    m_Localized: I will. If they come back, I'll ask them to read it again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294865
    m_Localized: I'd better smooth out the creases. I bet they have no idea I still
      have it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294866
    m_Localized: I asked an alien customer where they get starlight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294867
    m_Localized: We use it to keep the village running, too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294868
    m_Localized: Yeah. We think of the tree first, but they started by talking about
      paying for things.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294869
    m_Localized: Sometimes, passing Grandma's shop, I'd hear someone having a long
      talk inside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294870
    m_Localized: Even you leave without joining in sometimes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294871
    m_Localized: I wonder what they were talking about.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294872
    m_Localized: Of course. I don't join every conversation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294873
    m_Localized: You can tell from someone's face whether it's a good time to walk
      in smiling.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294874
    m_Localized: 'When I remember those days,

      I''m so glad you look strong
      and cheerful now.

      You''d better get a good night''s sleep tonight, okay?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294875
    m_Localized: An alien customer I'd met before waved to me first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294876
    m_Localized: Did you admit it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294877
    m_Localized: Next time you'll recognize them first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294878
    m_Localized: Yeah. I asked where we'd met.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294879
    m_Localized: I'd given them directions outside the store. Then I remembered.
      If I'd pretended to know, I'd still be wondering.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294880
    m_Localized: Don't worry too much. I'll always be right beside you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294881
    m_Localized: Mr. Horong even remembers things his regulars didn't buy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294882
    m_Localized: I wondered how long they'd stared at them for him to remember all
      this time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294883
    m_Localized: Maybe he thought they'd ask next time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294884
    m_Localized: You even asked him about that?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294885
    m_Localized: Exactly. I asked if that was why he remembered.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294886
    m_Localized: He said they might look for it when they came back. Things they
      don't buy never go in the ledger.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294887
    m_Localized: 'He looked like someone was picking on his own child!

      If
      anything happened to you, I bet he''d be the first one running over.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294888
    m_Localized: I got caught in another long chat outside the store. Everyone was
      talking about the alien customers who came back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294889
    m_Localized: You like it better this busy, don't you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294890
    m_Localized: Yeah. Much better.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294891
    m_Localized: The Moon Tree has its light back, and we can talk about something
      other than urgent worries.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294892
    m_Localized: Let's keep having tons of fun together from now on!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294893
    m_Localized: Different households have slightly different names for the same
      treat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294894
    m_Localized: I asked Grandma which was right. She asked which household I'd heard
      it from.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294895
    m_Localized: I was thinking of grinding up meteors that only grow on our moon
      and mixing them in. What do you think?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294896
    m_Localized: Maybe there isn't just one right name.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294897
    m_Localized: I'd like to hear those stories, too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294898
    m_Localized: Yeah. Then she got into who first called it that, and why.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294899
    m_Localized: I asked about one name and ended up sitting there for ages.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294900
    m_Localized: If business is slow, I guess I'll come ask you for advice!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294901
    m_Localized: 'Of course!

      For the owner of our village''s very first tea
      shop,

      I''ll serve up my absolute best one.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294902
    m_Localized: "Just you wait\u2014I'm going to build the greatest bakery chain
      in the universe~!!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294903
    m_Localized: Garam
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294904
    m_Localized: ...I hear you've taken over Grandma Deunhae's shop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294905
    m_Localized: Let me know if your ingredients change. I'll prepare what you need.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294906
    m_Localized: "I heard that Shopkeeper (\uD50C\uB808\uC774\uC5B4 \uC774\uB984)
      had come to the village."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294907
    m_Localized: I look forward to working with you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294908
    m_Localized: I'm counting on you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294909
    m_Localized: We'll be seeing a lot of each other.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294910
    m_Localized: ...Yes. Tell me how much you need and when you'll collect it. I'll
      have it ready.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294911
    m_Localized: I expect so.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294912
    m_Localized: ...You're here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294913
    m_Localized: Hello. What can I do for you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294914
    m_Localized: What is it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294915
    m_Localized: ...I have a moment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294916
    m_Localized: Go ahead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294917
    m_Localized: Ask about the request.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294918
    m_Localized: Everyday life
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294919
    m_Localized: Other rabbits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294920
    m_Localized: Old stories
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294921
    m_Localized: ...I'm checking inside the mortar.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294922
    m_Localized: ...Working hard again today, I see.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294923
    m_Localized: It is what I always do. ...You should not push yourself too hard
      either, Shopkeeper.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294924
    m_Localized: I'm pounding today's rice in smaller batches.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294925
    m_Localized: Wouldn't one big batch be easier?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294926
    m_Localized: Are you preparing mine, too?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294927
    m_Localized: Then the rice cakes would sit for too long.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294928
    m_Localized: Better to have them ready when they're collected.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294929
    m_Localized: I am glad. Idle thoughts disrupt the rhythm. The work demands focus.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294930
    m_Localized: ...Could you leave that space clear?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294931
    m_Localized: I need to bring the older sacks to the front.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294932
    m_Localized: Can I help?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294933
    m_Localized: Please move that empty sack to the side.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294934
    m_Localized: ...I'm taking a short break.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294935
    m_Localized: (He stands the heavy pestle to one side and stares blankly into
      space.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294936
    m_Localized: Sit beside him quietly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294937
    m_Localized: You're sweating quite a lot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294938
    m_Localized: (Garam shifts over, making room on the side free of flour.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294939
    m_Localized: '...I exerted myself somewhat.

      It is my duty to produce flour
      of the finest quality.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294940
    m_Localized: Some customers think I'm not listening because I stay quiet when
      Somi talks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294941
    m_Localized: You are listening, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294942
    m_Localized: ...Yes. I'm listening.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294943
    m_Localized: Maru recorded the rhythm of my pounding.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294944
    m_Localized: Maybe you get tired?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294945
    m_Localized: Seems so.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294946
    m_Localized: I took a break partway through today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294947
    m_Localized: Mr. Horong repaired this handle for me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294948
    m_Localized: It should last a while longer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294949
    m_Localized: Is it more comfortable than a new one?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294950
    m_Localized: ...My hands know where to go.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294951
    m_Localized: I do not know the precise reason.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294952
    m_Localized: A sack of rice flour once burst open.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294953
    m_Localized: That must have startled you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294954
    m_Localized: Yes. We were stunned for a moment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294955
    m_Localized: ...Then Somi started laughing. In the end, I did, too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294956
    m_Localized: I did not know what to say, so I simply kept pounding the mortar.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294957
    m_Localized: My hands shook terribly whenever I passed her the bag of rice cakes...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294958
    m_Localized: Once, just as we were closing, an alien customer who'd come a long
      way asked for rice cakes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294959
    m_Localized: We had some left, but they'd grown cold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294960
    m_Localized: Did you make fresh ones?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294961
    m_Localized: Yes. I asked them to wait a little.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294962
    m_Localized: I pounded another batch while Somi served tea.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294963
    m_Localized: We're preparing more rice with the alien customers returning.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294964
    m_Localized: They say the journey is easier now that the tree is recovering.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294965
    m_Localized: You're busy again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294966
    m_Localized: Yes. Somi is updating the ledger.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294967
    m_Localized: I'm checking how much to prepare.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294968
    m_Localized: ...Thank you for taking care of it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294969
    m_Localized: Thank you for attending to it. Your help made the work considerably
      easier.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294970
    m_Localized: We will speak again another time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294971
    m_Localized: The Moon Tree looked a little brighter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294972
    m_Localized: Yes. It was definitely different.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294973
    m_Localized: You went back to check?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294974
    m_Localized: Somi has been asking to walk home by the Moon Tree.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294975
    m_Localized: ...Yes. I don't mind a longer walk.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294976
    m_Localized: Do you like that route, too?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294977
    m_Localized: My father always put the tools down facing this way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294978
    m_Localized: I found myself doing the same.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294979
    m_Localized: ...I didn't understand as a child. They're easier to pick up here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294980
    m_Localized: ...Everyone gives it such a grand name. It is nothing special.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294981
    m_Localized: It is not impressive. It is merely a necessary part of making rice
      cakes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294982
    m_Localized: Garam, are you the rabbit from the legend?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294983
    m_Localized: I can't believe the legendary rabbit was real!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294984
    m_Localized: When I stop pounding, Somi looks over.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294985
    m_Localized: ...I apologize for startling you. The sound must have been too harsh.
      I will work more carefully.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294986
    m_Localized: ...You appear badly shaken. If there is a frightening memory behind
      it, do not force yourself to recall it. ...Would you like a glass of water?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294987
    m_Localized: (Garam remains visibly restless afterward.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294988
    m_Localized: Oh, it was just loud. I'm all right.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294989
    m_Localized: The Moon Tree has its light back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294990
    m_Localized: ...Yes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294991
    m_Localized: That must have been good to hear.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294992
    m_Localized: ...Everything's ready.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294993
    m_Localized: I'll go home with Somi when she finishes the ledger.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294994
    m_Localized: ...So, do not worry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294995
    m_Localized: Yes. It won't be long.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294996
    m_Localized: She waits for me some days, too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294997
    m_Localized: '...Thank you.

      If you ever face hardship, you may come to
      the mill at any time.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294998
    m_Localized: I will be here, as always.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294999
    m_Localized: You're waiting for her.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295000
    m_Localized: I'll be cheering for the peaceful life you share.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295001
    m_Localized: Nuri
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295002
    m_Localized: Um... I heard you've taken over Grandma Deunhae's shop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295003
    m_Localized: We'll still be able to have the treats she taught you to make. I'd
      like to visit, too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295004
    m_Localized: I've heard so much about the new tea shop. I'm happy to finally
      meet you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295005
    m_Localized: Of course. Come by anytime.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295006
    m_Localized: I'm looking forward to it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295007
    m_Localized: I will. I'll try to come when it isn't too busy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295008
    m_Localized: ...I'd like to take my time looking at the treats.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295009
    m_Localized: Um... The paths have been darker at night since the Moon Tree started
      withering.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295010
    m_Localized: When my sister is late, every sound at the door makes me look up,
      hoping she's back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295011
    m_Localized: You're worried about Bori?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295012
    m_Localized: Ask her to let you know when she'll be late.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295013
    m_Localized: Yes. She says she's fine, but...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295014
    m_Localized: If I wait outside, she worries about me instead. So I wait at home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295015
    m_Localized: I truly hope so.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295016
    m_Localized: I'd love to take a slow walk with my sister along the bright paths
      again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295017
    m_Localized: I heard teacups being set down when I passed your shop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295018
    m_Localized: The street was so quiet I could hear them outside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295019
    m_Localized: You could have come in.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295020
    m_Localized: I was getting the tea and treats ready.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295021
    m_Localized: I almost did... but I thought you had customers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295022
    m_Localized: Next time I'll ask instead of waiting by the door.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295023
    m_Localized: I'm sure you'll succeed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295024
    m_Localized: The more guests smile after tasting your sweets, the more life will
      return to the village.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295025
    m_Localized: Oh, you're here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295026
    m_Localized: What would you like to talk about today?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295027
    m_Localized: I was taking a little break. Would you... like to rest, too?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295028
    m_Localized: For some reason, I feel a little more at ease whenever you're here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295029
    m_Localized: Um, would it be all right to talk for a moment?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295030
    m_Localized: You don't mind talking for a little while, do you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295031
    m_Localized: Ask about the request.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295032
    m_Localized: Everyday life
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295033
    m_Localized: Other rabbits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295034
    m_Localized: Old stories
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295035
    m_Localized: The Moon Tree is a little brighter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295036
    m_Localized: Did Bori notice, too?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295037
    m_Localized: Yes. She said it really had changed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295038
    m_Localized: I asked my sister if we could walk a little farther.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295039
    m_Localized: You were the one who wanted to keep walking.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295040
    m_Localized: Yes. She said she had time today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295041
    m_Localized: I showed my sister a flower growing between the stones. She turned
      over a leaf.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295042
    m_Localized: Its light has definitely faded further.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295043
    m_Localized: I'll have to sell more rice cakes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295044
    m_Localized: Yes... Even the leaves seem paler than they used to be.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295046
    m_Localized: 'Oh, my parents told me you opened the tea shop

      because of
      the Moon Tree.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295047
    m_Localized: Um... I don't know all the details, but I'm always grateful to you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295048
    m_Localized: Um... Can you see the stars in the puddle?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295049
    m_Localized: The wind just scattered them. If we wait a little, they'll come
      back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295050
    m_Localized: Wait quietly with her.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295051
    m_Localized: Your hem will get wet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295052
    m_Localized: (Nuri waits for the ripples to settle, then points to one side of
      the water.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295053
    m_Localized: There. You can see them again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295054
    m_Localized: 'Oh... I did get a little wet, but I''m fine!

      I was so busy
      capturing that beautiful planet that I didn''t even notice. Hehe.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295055
    m_Localized: Sometimes my sister and I don't say anything while we have tea.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295056
    m_Localized: It's nice to be together without talking, too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295057
    m_Localized: Loud noises make me uneasy somehow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295058
    m_Localized: Yes. She says she likes that time, too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295059
    m_Localized: I see... I worried because red light and loud noises always seem
      to startle you. When I'm beside you, I'll quietly watch over you so you won't
      have to worry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295060
    m_Localized: The Moon Tree has its light back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295061
    m_Localized: You're less worried now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295062
    m_Localized: Yes. She likes it, too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295063
    m_Localized: When she comes in, I'm not just watching the door. I can tell her
      what I've been doing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295064
    m_Localized: I met the alien customer I gave directions to again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295065
    m_Localized: Which ones do they like?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295066
    m_Localized: You're getting to know each other.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295067
    m_Localized: They'd chosen my favorite.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295068
    m_Localized: Yes, of course! Next time they visit, I'll quietly introduce you.
      We can all share something delicious together!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295069
    m_Localized: My sister altered some of her old clothes for me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295070
    m_Localized: I thought she'd just shorten the sleeves, but she moved the pockets,
      too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295071
    m_Localized: So they'd fit your hands.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295072
    m_Localized: Do you still wear them?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295073
    m_Localized: Yes. I reached in, and they were right there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295074
    m_Localized: That's right! My sister can even make pretty clothes from Moon Tree
      leaves.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295075
    m_Localized: It would be lovely if she made something for you too... I'll ask
      her later!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295076
    m_Localized: When my sister is sewing, I wait until her hands stop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295077
    m_Localized: But she says I shouldn't stand there so quietly if I have something
      to tell her.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295078
    m_Localized: Because she doesn't know how long you've been there?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295079
    m_Localized: Then you can speak up if it's urgent.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295080
    m_Localized: Yes. When she looks up and sees me, she asks how long I've been
      waiting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295081
    m_Localized: Now I say I'm there first. If it isn't urgent, I wait after that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295082
    m_Localized: Exactly! She never overlooks even a single loose thread. She's a
      real professional.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295083
    m_Localized: I told Maru I'd stopped understanding partway through his explanation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295084
    m_Localized: He explained it again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295085
    m_Localized: You can tell him next time, too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295086
    m_Localized: Yes. It was easier to understand than the first time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295087
    m_Localized: He'd thought I understood everything.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295088
    m_Localized: "What's a \u201Ctsundere\u201D? Anyway, he grumbles, but he always
      prepares my favorite snacks in advance."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295089
    m_Localized: He only says strange things when we meet... but he's a kind big
      brother.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295090
    m_Localized: I spent ages choosing something in Mr. Horong's store, but left
      without buying anything.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295091
    m_Localized: He said it was all right, didn't he?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295092
    m_Localized: He does that for me too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295093
    m_Localized: Yes. He told me to look again next time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295094
    m_Localized: Oh? He does it for you too? His eyes seem especially misty whenever
      he looks at you... Or am I imagining it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295095
    m_Localized: On nights when alien customers stayed late, the tree shone for longer,
      too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295096
    m_Localized: We thought the tree was making it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295097
    m_Localized: Yes. All I noticed was how bright the tree was that night.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295098
    m_Localized: Looking back, it could have been the starlight the customers brought,
      still lingering there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295099
    m_Localized: I gave an alien customer from another world directions to the tea
      shop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295100
    m_Localized: They did. Thank you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295101
    m_Localized: Was it hard to explain?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295102
    m_Localized: Oh, I'm glad.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295103
    m_Localized: Next time I see them, I'd like to ask which treats they tried.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295104
    m_Localized: 'Aren''t you scared? They travel in such enormous spaceships...

      But
      if they come to eat your sweets, perhaps you could become friends right away.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295105
    m_Localized: These days, <color=#2F6FDB><b>the Moon Tree's light stays long after
      the alien customers have passed</b></color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295106
    m_Localized: Do you usually walk at the same time?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295107
    m_Localized: Do you like watching the shadows?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295108
    m_Localized: Mostly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295109
    m_Localized: 'I''m not sure. I like the village as it is now!

      It smells
      of delicious rice cakes, and everyone works so hard.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295110
    m_Localized: You remembered my request. Thank you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295111
    m_Localized: I was so hungry, and you arrived at the perfect time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295112
    m_Localized: I'll let you know if I need anything again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295113
    m_Localized: Maru
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295114
    m_Localized: I hear you've taken over Grandma Deunhae's shop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295115
    m_Localized: Will you be serving the treats she taught you to make? You must
      have a great deal to prepare.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295116
    m_Localized: I have already received a certain amount of information about you...
      but a direct introduction would be more accurate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295117
    m_Localized: I still have plenty to ask her.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295118
    m_Localized: I'm counting on you, Maru.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295119
    m_Localized: Naturally. She ran that shop for years.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295120
    m_Localized: Of course. I'd be interested to hear what the alien customers think,
      when you have the time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295121
    m_Localized: I'm keeping a record of the Moon Tree's brightness.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295122
    m_Localized: There are too few records from before it began to wither. I can't
      establish exactly when it started to change.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295123
    m_Localized: We can start keeping records now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295124
    m_Localized: Is there anything I can do?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295125
    m_Localized: Yes. That's why I observe it at the same time each day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295126
    m_Localized: I'd rather not have to guess what it looked like today, either.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295127
    m_Localized: It is too early to reach a definitive conclusion.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295128
    m_Localized: However, selling sweets to alien guests and collecting their Starlight
      is certainly worthy of observation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295129
    m_Localized: I got stuck trying to explain the word 'nutty' to an alien customer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295130
    m_Localized: In the end, I showed them the treat. That cleared things up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295131
    m_Localized: Tasting it is quicker.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295132
    m_Localized: They might have a different word on their planet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295133
    m_Localized: It was quicker. I tried describing the flavor, but words weren't
      enough.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295134
    m_Localized: Though I still wonder whether we experienced the same taste.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295135
    m_Localized: An intriguing proposal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295136
    m_Localized: Even if my purpose is observation, including a tasting would enable
      a more accurate analysis.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295137
    m_Localized: Ah, you're here. I was just organizing my notes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295138
    m_Localized: You have a moment for conversation, I presume?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295139
    m_Localized: One moment. Let me finish this line.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295140
    m_Localized: ...There. What can I do for you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295141
    m_Localized: Hello. How is business today?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295142
    m_Localized: As it happens, I have some interesting data to share with you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295143
    m_Localized: Listen to his concerns.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295144
    m_Localized: Everyday life
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295145
    m_Localized: The other rabbits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295146
    m_Localized: Old stories
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295147
    m_Localized: Thank you for listening.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295148
    m_Localized: ...Explaining it aloud has shown me something I overlooked.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295149
    m_Localized: Please return when you have time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295150
    m_Localized: The Moon Tree is brighter than before. The difference holds even
      at the same time of day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295151
    m_Localized: You're happy about it too, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295152
    m_Localized: ...Yes. For once, I'm pleased to have to revise my notes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295153
    m_Localized: I also record how many treats I eat during a tasting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295154
    m_Localized: How many did you eat today?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295155
    m_Localized: Or did you just want more?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295156
    m_Localized: ...Six.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295157
    m_Localized: The last three were to confirm the initial results.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295158
    m_Localized: I suspect a specific region of your brain may be overloading while
      attempting to retrieve memories. Do not overexert yourself for the time being.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295159
    m_Localized: Your physical eyesight may be sound, but at times you look past
      what is before you, as though staring at something very far away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295160
    m_Localized: At moments like those, I find myself wishing I could lend you my
      glasses.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295161
    m_Localized: I'm curious about what you mean by 'just enough.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295162
    m_Localized: That's how Grandma taught me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295163
    m_Localized: It's hard to put into words.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295164
    m_Localized: Then you have a standard you can recognize by touch.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295165
    m_Localized: "\u201CInstinct\u201D... What an exceptionally unscientific word."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295166
    m_Localized: "And yet, the fact that your \u201Cinstinct\u201D ranks first in
      preference among the village rabbits is highly intriguing."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295167
    m_Localized: Miso brings me plenty of information that isn't in my records.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295168
    m_Localized: Which route someone took, or where they hesitated. Things like that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295169
    m_Localized: She's a big help, then.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295170
    m_Localized: Miso says you ask a lot of questions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295171
    m_Localized: Yes. Though first I check whether she heard it firsthand.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295172
    m_Localized: Lately, she tells me before I even ask.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295173
    m_Localized: Ever since we were children, Miso has functioned as a stabilizing
      agent for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295174
    m_Localized: <color=#2F6FDB><b>The Moon Tree's recovery and the increase in alien
      customers seem to happen around the same time</b></color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295175
    m_Localized: It could just be word about the shop spreading.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295176
    m_Localized: Could the tree be drawing them here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295177
    m_Localized: Possibly. Word of your shop is certainly part of it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295178
    m_Localized: Indeed. This system reproduces a natural light source through technology,
      allowing our ecosystem's thermal cycle to remain stable.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295179
    m_Localized: I was watching Garam work at the mill when he asked me to move.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295180
    m_Localized: I thought I was tucked away in a corner. It turned out to be where
      the sacks needed to go.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295181
    m_Localized: Where do you stand now?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295182
    m_Localized: You lose track of your surroundings, don't you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295183
    m_Localized: In the spot Somi showed me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295184
    m_Localized: Garam no longer has to stop in front of me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295185
    m_Localized: It is a peculiar synchronization that cannot be explained through
      any physical or logical basis.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295186
    m_Localized: Objectively, Somi's energy expenditure is overwhelming. Yet Garam
      absorbs all that energy and silently continues producing results.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295187
    m_Localized: Their interaction defies every law of dynamics known to me. A truly
      fascinating harmony.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295188
    m_Localized: We've always understood that the Moon Tree produces starlight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295189
    m_Localized: Maybe they came because the tree was bright?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295190
    m_Localized: That was my first reading too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295191
    m_Localized: This entry only says 'unusually bright.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295192
    m_Localized: There's no date. I can't even tell whether it's the same day as
      the previous page.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295193
    m_Localized: That must be frustrating to read.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295194
    m_Localized: It is. Though I found a similar entry in my own notebook.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295195
    m_Localized: At the time, I was sure I'd remember.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295196
    m_Localized: "Everything you told me\u2014I have documented all of it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295197
    m_Localized: .....
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295198
    m_Localized: Someday, I intend to logically prove the true nature of the horror
      you were forced to witness.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295199
    m_Localized: Starlight is <color=#2F6FDB><b>an energy resource that occurs naturally
      on many planets</b></color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295200
    m_Localized: Horong's shop must bring some in too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877696
    m_Localized: Yes. Business at Horong's shop is picking up again too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877697
    m_Localized: And <color=#2F6FDB><b>starlight seems to remain in the village longer
      as the tree recovers</b></color>. We should measure how long it stays, as well
      as how much arrives.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877698
    m_Localized: I found a day with no sales in Horong's ledger and asked whether
      he'd had no customers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877699
    m_Localized: He said he had. Visitors who bought nothing simply weren't in the
      ledger.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877700
    m_Localized: Visitor numbers and sales aren't the same thing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877701
    m_Localized: He's simply kindhearted.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877702
    m_Localized: Exactly. So I asked him about that day separately.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877703
    m_Localized: I can't judge visitor numbers from the ledger alone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877704
    m_Localized: He appears entirely devoid of a merchant's desire for profit. What
      objective could justify accepting such losses?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877705
    m_Localized: Comparing the records with the alien customers' accounts has given
      us an answer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877706
    m_Localized: Is that why the village is easier to reach?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877707
    m_Localized: Was my original idea wrong, then?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877708
    m_Localized: Yes. <color=#2F6FDB><b>As the tree recovers, the connection between
      Moon Village and other planets becomes more stable</b></color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877709
    m_Localized: I look forward to the results. Combining your intuitive recipes
      with my statistical analysis should maximize the economic value of this commercial
      district.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877710
    m_Localized: <color=#2F6FDB><b>We still don't know why the tree first began to
      wither</b></color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877711
    m_Localized: 'But we can explain what followed: as it weakened, the route grew
      unstable, fewer alien customers came, and less incoming starlight left the
      tree weaker still.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877712
    m_Localized: So we haven't found the original cause.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877713
    m_Localized: I heard an unpleasant sound.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877714
    m_Localized: Correct. That's a separate question.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877715
    m_Localized: Knowing how it recovers doesn't tell us why it first began to wither.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877716
    m_Localized: "The other rabbits insist it was merely thunder, but my recording
      device captured it clearly. It was not a natural sound\u2014it was an artificial
      rupture."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877717
    m_Localized: "Your body still appears to associate that sound with an \u201Cexplosion.\u201D
      Focus on my voice. It is a stable, low-mid frequency of 150 Hz."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877718
    m_Localized: The Moon Tree has regained its glow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877719
    m_Localized: Did you erase the old explanation?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877720
    m_Localized: I left it alongside the new one. I need to know when I changed my
      mind, and what led me to do so.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877721
    m_Localized: Today's observations are brief. Little has changed since yesterday.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877722
    m_Localized: If the tree is holding steady, that's no bad thing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877723
    m_Localized: Then come take a break at the shop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877724
    m_Localized: Write an amazing paper someday and show me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877725
    m_Localized: Gladly. I'll leave my notebook closed today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877726
    m_Localized: You may look forward to it. Just as you grew your shop, I will prove
      myself in my field through meaningful data and results.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877727
    m_Localized: Bori
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877728
    m_Localized: "I hear you've taken over Grandma Deunhae's shop, (\uD50C\uB808\uC774\uC5B4
      \uC774\uB984)."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877729
    m_Localized: I suppose we'll start seeing your own taste in the place now. Since
      I run the clothes shop, we'll have plenty to talk about.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877730
    m_Localized: Yes, let's compare notes on business.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877731
    m_Localized: I'm glad to have you around.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877732
    m_Localized: Of course. One shopkeeper to another, we'll have things to discuss.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877733
    m_Localized: I'm curious how things work at a tea shop, too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877734
    m_Localized: Could you look at this sleeve from over there?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877735
    m_Localized: It looks a little long.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877736
    m_Localized: Why not try moving around in it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877737
    m_Localized: That's what was bothering me too. I'll shorten it a little more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877738
    m_Localized: Finishing the sewing doesn't mean it's finished.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877739
    m_Localized: 'That attitude is more than enough.

      The more care you put
      in, the more the Moon Tree''s light will return.

      I''ll do everything
      I can to help as well.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877740
    m_Localized: I picked out some fabric to match the Moon Tree, but it doesn't
      match anymore.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877741
    m_Localized: Will you choose a new fabric?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877742
    m_Localized: That must worry you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877743
    m_Localized: No. I'm keeping this color.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877744
    m_Localized: This is how it used to look. I didn't choose wrong.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877745
    m_Localized: 'The automated machines would stop, and your electric oven would
      fail as well.

      That''s precisely why we need to gather Starlight more
      diligently!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877746
    m_Localized: Where an apron pocket looks good and where your hand reaches aren't
      the same place.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877747
    m_Localized: I'm going to move it on this one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877748
    m_Localized: I've noticed that with my shop apron too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877749
    m_Localized: It'll change the look a bit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877750
    m_Localized: Then tell me what bothered you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877751
    m_Localized: I can't learn everything just by wearing my own work apron.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877752
    m_Localized: "Maru only talks about data. It's tedious.\nYou're diligently feeding
      Starlight into the Moon Tree, (\uD50C\uB808\uC774\uC5B4 \uC774\uB984),\nso
      I'm sure everything will stabilize soon enough."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877753
    m_Localized: By the time Garam lifts a sack, Somi has already cleared a space
      for it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877754
    m_Localized: Would you like someone to work with?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877755
    m_Localized: They've been doing it for years.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877756
    m_Localized: When I'm busy, yes. Though I'm rather particular about how I do
      things...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877757
    m_Localized: 'Don''t be afraid.

      Just think of him as a robot Somi knows
      how to operate.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877758
    m_Localized: An alien customer from another planet looked at an outfit and asked
      if it would be comfortable with their arms moving like this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877759
    m_Localized: I expected a question about the color. They went straight to that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877760
    m_Localized: They must move differently in their clothes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877761
    m_Localized: Can you make all the changes they need?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877762
    m_Localized: Yes. I didn't understand from their description.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877763
    m_Localized: 'It''s less about wealth and more about having different resources.

      What
      may be ordinary space dust to them is a power source that restores our hearts.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877764
    m_Localized: Which is why I charge them a premium for my clothes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877765
    m_Localized: Consider that my lesson in business. Hehe.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877766
    m_Localized: When I was mending Grandma Deunhae's clothes, she asked me to look
      at the sleeves before the worn patches.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877767
    m_Localized: That sounds like Grandma.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877768
    m_Localized: Didn't you suggest something new?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877769
    m_Localized: Doesn't it? I understood once I tried it on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877770
    m_Localized: There was something more pressing than how it looked.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877771
    m_Localized: 'A true master is bound to be demanding.

      Isn''t that strictness
      what honed your skill to such a fine edge?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877772
    m_Localized: I've brought some fabric out of storage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877773
    m_Localized: With more alien customers visiting, people are asking for colors
      that hardly used to sell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877774
    m_Localized: Will you put it all on display?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877775
    m_Localized: That'll change the feel of the shop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877776
    m_Localized: A little at a time. Put it all out at once and it gets lost.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877777
    m_Localized: I need to decide which color catches the eye first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877778
    m_Localized: 'Of course. I couldn''t make clothes without my modern sewing machine
      either.

      But your rice cakes must fill the emptiness

      that machines
      never can.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877779
    m_Localized: That's how this village maintains its balance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877780
    m_Localized: The Moon Tree's leaves look a little more vivid.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877781
    m_Localized: Yes. I can tell a difference like that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877782
    m_Localized: You're sure they've changed?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877783
    m_Localized: I'm thinking of putting a different color inside a garment. I got
      the idea when Nuri showed me the underside of a leaf.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877784
    m_Localized: Wouldn't it? That's what I'm leaning toward.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877785
    m_Localized: Doesn't it sound lovely? I'm carefully designing it so the silhouette
      falls perfectly in the light. You'll be the first to see it when it's finished.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877786
    m_Localized: A bright lining would look lovely when you move.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877787
    m_Localized: I'd go bold from the start.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877788
    m_Localized: Whenever I show Nuri new clothes, she says they're fine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877789
    m_Localized: Maybe. But she kept touching the sleeve.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877790
    m_Localized: Maybe she really likes them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877791
    m_Localized: It's brighter near the Moon Tree now, so I spread out some fabric
      there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877792
    m_Localized: I'll look a little longer. It can't only look good in one place.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877793
    m_Localized: The customer won't be wearing it just in my workroom.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877794
    m_Localized: Will you give it more thought?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877795
    m_Localized: Nuri wants to alter her own pocket.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877796
    m_Localized: Yes. So I kept my hands off.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877797
    m_Localized: I imagine every older sister feels the same. Please stay beside
      Nuri as a good friend, so she never loses heart.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877798
    m_Localized: She wants to try it for herself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877799
    m_Localized: Was it hard for you to hold back?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877800
    m_Localized: An alien customer said they'd like to come back for a fitting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877801
    m_Localized: Yes. Before, they hesitated over when they'd even be able to come.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877802
    m_Localized: It must be easier to plan a return visit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877803
    m_Localized: The first outfit I made had sleeves of different lengths.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877804
    m_Localized: Of course. Leaving it that way would have bothered me every time
      I saw it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877805
    m_Localized: Did you fix it in the end?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877806
    m_Localized: The Moon Tree has its color back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877807
    m_Localized: Yes. I never meant to change it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877808
    m_Localized: I wanted to see that I'd chosen the right color after all.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877809
    m_Localized: You kept it all this time?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877810
    m_Localized: I want to use more of Moon Village's colors in my clothes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877811
    m_Localized: Something to remind customers of this place when they're back on
      their own planets.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877812
    m_Localized: Of course. But just using the leaves would get repetitive, so I'll
      look at the shadows too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877813
    m_Localized: Thank you. I'll never forget your support. Let's both keep shining
      brilliantly in our own places!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877814
    m_Localized: You'll use the Moon Tree's colors too, then.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877815
    m_Localized: They'll need to be comfortable for everyday wear.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877816
    m_Localized: Somi
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877817
    m_Localized: Oh, there you are! I hear you've taken over Grandma Deunhae's shop!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877818
    m_Localized: So you'll be serving the treats she taught you now. Let us know
      what ingredients you need. We'll have them ready!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877819
    m_Localized: I heard all about you ages ago, Boss. Let's become great friends!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877820
    m_Localized: I'm counting on you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877821
    m_Localized: It's reassuring to have you here, Somi.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877822
    m_Localized: Of course! Who gets the quantities right from the start? We'll work
      it out as you go.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877823
    m_Localized: Oh, that does me good to hear.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877824
    m_Localized: There you are! Come and sit down!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877825
    m_Localized: What should we talk about first?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877826
    m_Localized: Oh, you've caught me at a quiet moment. What's on your mind?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877827
    m_Localized: It's just the right moment for chatting along to the pounding mortar.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877828
    m_Localized: Hello! You've got time for a little chat, haven't you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877829
    m_Localized: I've got tons of cheerful stories for you today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877830
    m_Localized: Ask about her request.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877831
    m_Localized: Everyday life
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877832
    m_Localized: The other rabbits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877833
    m_Localized: Old stories
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877834
    m_Localized: Hello! The mill's a bit quiet today, isn't it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877835
    m_Localized: It must be hard to know how much to prepare.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877836
    m_Localized: That's the hardest part. Make less, and you worry there won't be
      enough.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877837
    m_Localized: Tell me ahead of time if your shop needs a different amount. We'll
      work it out together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877838
    m_Localized: I'll carry this wonderful mood straight into making perfect ingredients
      today!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877839
    m_Localized: Some rabbits ask if it's lunchtime whenever the pounding stops.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877840
    m_Localized: They hear it every day. I suppose they've learned our breaks too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877841
    m_Localized: Do you always take breaks at the same time?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877842
    m_Localized: Do alien customers recognize the sound too?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877843
    m_Localized: More or less. It changes when we have lots of orders.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877844
    m_Localized: 'I can understand that!

      Garam''s arm strength is no joke.
      Haha!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877845
    m_Localized: Have you seen the flowers outside? Garam's been watering them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877846
    m_Localized: At first, he said they were in the way of the sacks. These days,
      he walks around them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877847
    m_Localized: He must like them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877848
    m_Localized: Do you look after them too?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877849
    m_Localized: You'd think so! But ask him and all he'll say is there's plenty
      of room to pass.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877850
    m_Localized: That's his way of saying he likes flowers, apparently.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877851
    m_Localized: Oh, he'd never do it if I ordered him to!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877852
    m_Localized: 'He must have started caring without even realizing it.

      He''s
      secretly softhearted.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877853
    m_Localized: When you taste a rice cake, do you dip it in honey right away?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877854
    m_Localized: Garam always eats the first piece plain. Says he needs to check
      how well it's been pounded.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877855
    m_Localized: What about you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877856
    m_Localized: You're both very thorough.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877857
    m_Localized: I try another piece once it's cooled a bit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877858
    m_Localized: Customers don't always eat them the moment we hand them over. I
      need to know how they'll taste then.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877859
    m_Localized: 'Oh, Boss, you eat far too little!

      If you ever run out of
      energy, dash over to the mill.

      I''ll fix you a hearty snack!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877860
    m_Localized: Sometimes I need to ask Mr. Horong for something in a hurry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877861
    m_Localized: What if he can't help?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877862
    m_Localized: Then we find another way. Asking doesn't mean he has to say yes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877863
    m_Localized: He tells us when he can't manage it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877864
    m_Localized: Maru came to watch the pounding and stood right in the passage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877865
    m_Localized: You told him, didn't you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877866
    m_Localized: That must have frustrated Garam.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877867
    m_Localized: Yes. I showed him a spot where he could see everything.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877868
    m_Localized: He's stood there ever since. And Garam doesn't have to keep stopping
      on his way through.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877869
    m_Localized: Not necessarily.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877870
    m_Localized: Garam pretends to ignore him, but after Maru leaves, he quietly
      asks me whether his pounding looked strange!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877871
    m_Localized: Watching those two bicker is like seeing a comedy duo!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877872
    m_Localized: A sack of rice flour once burst and turned the whole mill floor
      white.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877873
    m_Localized: Garam and I just stood there staring at it for a while.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877874
    m_Localized: That must have been a shock.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877875
    m_Localized: It must have taken ages to clean up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877876
    m_Localized: It was! But then I saw we were both white from head to toe, and
      I couldn't help laughing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877877
    m_Localized: Ever since, I check the ties on every sack that comes in, and Garam
      checks the bottom.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877878
    m_Localized: 'But then one day...

      Oh, this is getting long. Shall I tell
      you the rest next time?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877879
    m_Localized: "Of course! \u201CGive up\u201D isn't in my dictionary.\nYou have
      no idea how hard I worked just to make eye contact!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877880
    m_Localized: 'But then one day...

      Oh, this is getting long. I''ll tell
      you the rest next time!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877881
    m_Localized: Once, just as we were closing, an alien customer came a long way
      looking for rice cakes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877882
    m_Localized: We had some left, but Garam asked them to wait and started pounding
      a fresh batch.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877883
    m_Localized: Right before closing?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877884
    m_Localized: The customer must have been pleased.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877885
    m_Localized: Yes. I suppose he didn't want to give them cold rice cakes after
      such a long journey.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877886
    m_Localized: I served them tea and kept them company while they waited.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877887
    m_Localized: I hope you find a rabbit like that someday too, Boss!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877888
    m_Localized: When I finish the ledger these days, the Moon Tree is still glowing
      outside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877889
    m_Localized: It was like that years ago, on the nights alien customers kept us
      open late.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877890
    m_Localized: Was it brighter on busy days back then too?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877891
    m_Localized: Now that you mention it, the two did go together. I only thought
      about how bright the tree was.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877892
    m_Localized: I'd stop outside and look for a bit before heading in, just like
      now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877893
    m_Localized: You remembered my request. Thank you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877894
    m_Localized: You made the mill's work so much easier. I knew I could count on
      you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877895
    m_Localized: I'll repay you with even better ingredients next time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877896
    m_Localized: Garam was the first to mention the Moon Tree getting brighter!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877897
    m_Localized: Usually I'm the one who brings that up. The starlight you've been
      collecting must be helping.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877898
    m_Localized: Of course. Not saying anything doesn't mean he wasn't worried.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877899
    m_Localized: You've both been keeping an eye on it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877900
    m_Localized: An alien customer from another planet tried your treats and came
      all the way here!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877901
    m_Localized: They asked what you make them with, so I showed them the rice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877902
    m_Localized: I mean it! I'm not just being polite!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877903
    m_Localized: They stared at it and asked if this really became those rice cakes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877904
    m_Localized: It's familiar to us, but I suppose it's surprising the first time.
      They watched Garam at work before they left too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877905
    m_Localized: What did they say?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877906
    m_Localized: Even when an old regular comes back, I can't just prepare their
      usual order.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877907
    m_Localized: It is! Though I was so pleased to see them I nearly missed the rest
      of the order.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877908
    m_Localized: That's a nice change.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877909
    m_Localized: Whenever Grandma Deunhae collected her flour, she'd feel it first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877910
    m_Localized: I thought so. Ingredients can't be exactly the same every time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877911
    m_Localized: "Well... I only happened to see her briefly, a very long time ago!
      I startled you by bringing up the past, didn't I? Sorry\u2014I'm so sorry.
      That was thoughtless of me. ...I should get back to work!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877912
    m_Localized: Yes, that's how she taught me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877913
    m_Localized: She must have been particular.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877914
    m_Localized: Garam and I were talking about orders on the way home, so I said,
      'That's enough mill talk.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877915
    m_Localized: Then we both went quiet for a bit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877916
    m_Localized: No. It's what we'd spent the whole day doing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877917
    m_Localized: After a while, he asked if I'd watered the flowers. They're outside
      the mill too, but I let that one pass.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877918
    m_Localized: And I'll always be cheering for you too, Boss!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877919
    m_Localized: Couldn't think of anything else right away?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877920
    m_Localized: The Moon Tree has its glow back!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877921
    m_Localized: A returning alien customer asked how I'd been, and for a moment
      I had too much to say to answer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877922
    m_Localized: It has. I never did tell them everything.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877923
    m_Localized: But once I'd served the rice cakes and sat down with them, it finally
      sank in that they were back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877924
    m_Localized: A lot has happened.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877925
    m_Localized: You should drop by sometimes when you don't need ingredients.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877926
    m_Localized: Lovely! I'll tell Garam to sit down once he's finished too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877927
    m_Localized: Of course! You know you're always our top VIP, right? Let's both
      keep working hard and living brilliantly. We can do it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877928
    m_Localized: I'll come by just to hear your stories.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877929
    m_Localized: Could I come after I close the shop?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877930
    m_Localized: Horong
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877931
    m_Localized: Ho ho, so you're the owner of Grandma Deunhae's shop now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877932
    m_Localized: Carrying on what she taught you with your own two hands. Let me
      know if you need different supplies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877933
    m_Localized: I'm glad to see a young rabbit running a shop of their own, though
      I can't help but worry a little... In any case, welcome.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877934
    m_Localized: I'll be counting on you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877935
    m_Localized: I'm a little nervous about running it myself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877936
    m_Localized: And I'll be counting on you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877937
    m_Localized: Understandable. Making the treats and running the shop are different
      matters.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877938
    m_Localized: Hello there. Stepped away from the shop for a moment?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877939
    m_Localized: What shall we talk about today?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877940
    m_Localized: Come in. Care to sit for a while?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877941
    m_Localized: Seeing your face is becoming every bit as pleasant as minding the
      shop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877942
    m_Localized: I've just finished putting things away. What can I do for you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877943
    m_Localized: You have a moment to chat, don't you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877944
    m_Localized: Ask about his request.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877945
    m_Localized: Everyday life
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877946
    m_Localized: The other rabbits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877947
    m_Localized: Old stories
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877948
    m_Localized: Do you rest when there are no customers?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877949
    m_Localized: From what I see, you seem to find another job for every quiet moment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877950
    m_Localized: I keep noticing things that need doing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877951
    m_Localized: I know the feeling. Tidy one thing, and the next catches your eye.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877952
    m_Localized: Sometimes I make myself step outside. Out of sight of the counter,
      my hands finally rest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877953
    m_Localized: It may have been Grandma Deunhae's shop, but you'll find things
      that don't suit you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877954
    m_Localized: If you want to move something, give it a try.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877955
    m_Localized: I'm hesitant to change her arrangement.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877956
    m_Localized: Are there things I could fix myself?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877957
    m_Localized: She left it in your hands so you could use it, didn't she?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877958
    m_Localized: It's good that our young shopkeeper is capable, but... you ought
      to accept a helping paw now and then. Don't try to carry everything alone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877959
    m_Localized: Do you ever think, 'I'll eat after this customer,' and end up having
      a late meal?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877960
    m_Localized: I've put off more meals that way than I care to count.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877961
    m_Localized: It's hard when you run the shop alone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877962
    m_Localized: It is. These days, I try to stop for a little while when it's time
      to eat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877963
    m_Localized: Better than realizing much later that I've forgotten a meal altogether.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877964
    m_Localized: I started gathering Grandma Deunhae's usual supplies, but she told
      me to ask you first now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877965
    m_Localized: I'm still learning too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877966
    m_Localized: She must still worry about it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877967
    m_Localized: No doubt. But you're the one using the supplies, so you're the one
      I should ask.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877968
    m_Localized: Tell me what suits you. It needn't be the old order.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877969
    m_Localized: Ho ho, every word of that nagging is meant to do you good.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877970
    m_Localized: Besides, not everyone is lucky enough to have someone nag them so.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877971
    m_Localized: Bori asks what something is for. Nuri holds it and studies it for
      a long time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877972
    m_Localized: They may come together, but they choose at different speeds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877973
    m_Localized: You give Nuri time, don't you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877974
    m_Localized: I'd expect Bori to choose for her.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877975
    m_Localized: I do other things while I wait.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877976
    m_Localized: I imagine it would be harder to choose with me standing there watching.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877977
    m_Localized: Little Nuri is especially fond of you. Look after her like a younger
      sister now and then, would you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877978
    m_Localized: Bori is a deeply thoughtful child. She may be quiet, but when someone
      needs help, she's always the first to offer a paw.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877979
    m_Localized: If she's helping you like that, then she must have truly opened
      her heart to you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877980
    m_Localized: Maru pointed to a day with no sales and asked whether no one had
      come.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877981
    m_Localized: Someone might just stop by to say hello.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877982
    m_Localized: Exactly. One rabbit stayed for quite a chat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877983
    m_Localized: It's only a date in the ledger, but now I think of it, quite a lot
      happened that day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877984
    m_Localized: The old ledger shows <color=#2F6FDB><b>plenty of starlight coming
      in when we had lots of alien customers</b></color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877985
    m_Localized: So it wasn't all coming from the tree.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877986
    m_Localized: I took that starlight in my own hands each time, yet I never connected
      the two.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877987
    m_Localized: I didn't expect this ledger to tell us anything about the tree.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877988
    m_Localized: A returning regular asked for something they'd considered buying
      on their last visit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877989
    m_Localized: Did you still have it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877990
    m_Localized: I did. I hadn't set it aside for them, but it happened to still
      be here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266304
    m_Localized: Before I handed it over, we spent a good while catching up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266305
    m_Localized: If... if there is some reason they cannot appear before you now,
      it isn't because they don't love you. It must be because they want to protect
      you. Someday... you will meet them. You have my word.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266306
    m_Localized: You remembered my request. Thank you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266307
    m_Localized: Thanks to you, I finished the shop work with far less trouble.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266308
    m_Localized: I'm truly grateful. If you need anything next time, let this old
      shopkeeper lend a paw.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266309
    m_Localized: I looked at the Moon Tree while bringing in stock. Its light seemed
      a little clearer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266310
    m_Localized: When you've kept watch over one place as long as I have, you notice
      even the smallest changes. Everything had been so dim, so this is a welcome
      sight. Thanks to your hard work, the town seems to be breathing again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266311
    m_Localized: You noticed it too, Horong.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266312
    m_Localized: Moon Village rabbits like to save the string their treats were wrapped
      in.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266313
    m_Localized: Where it's suitable. I keep string for food separate from string
      for tying other things.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266314
    m_Localized: Quite so. Life on the moon is always like this, but this year feels
      especially harsh. Mind your stock, of course, but your health comes first.
      Don't overdo it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266315
    m_Localized: Do you use it again?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266316
    m_Localized: Can you tell who it came from?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266317
    m_Localized: An alien customer I hadn't seen in a long time stopped by.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266318
    m_Localized: They found it easier this time. And they'd heard about your tea
      shop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266319
    m_Localized: Good. Working hard while you're young is admirable, but don't suffer
      in silence. Remember that someone is always here, quietly cheering you on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266320
    m_Localized: Did they say it's better now?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266321
    m_Localized: You can't know why someone stops coming.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266322
    m_Localized: When I started out, I filled every empty spot on a shelf straight
      away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266323
    m_Localized: I thought a good shop meant having plenty on display.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266324
    m_Localized: A customer tried to pick something up and knocked the things beside
      it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266325
    m_Localized: Yes... Perhaps all I can do for someone is remain at a distance
      and quietly watch over them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266326
    m_Localized: It must have been hard to pick anything.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266327
    m_Localized: Do you still move things around?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266328
    m_Localized: These days, people stop to talk while I'm bringing things in.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266329
    m_Localized: I tell them I'll just put down what I'm carrying first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266330
    m_Localized: You must end up closing late.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266331
    m_Localized: So the Moon Tree has been <color=#2F6FDB><b>holding the starlight
      from outside, keeping it here in the village</b></color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266332
    m_Localized: It seems so. When the recovering tree steadies the connection to
      other planets, alien customers can visit again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266333
    m_Localized: Your tea shop has brought customers back to mine as well.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266334
    m_Localized: All the village shops have been part of it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266335
    m_Localized: The Moon Tree has its glow back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266336
    m_Localized: There were days I thought of closing. But someone still needed something,
      so I opened again the next morning.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266337
    m_Localized: And here we are.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266338
    m_Localized: (Horong bows his head slightly and seems to wipe away a tear.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266339
    m_Localized: You've kept it going all this time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266340
    m_Localized: I've chosen tomorrow's stock.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266341
    m_Localized: Some, yes. And things for new customers too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266342
    m_Localized: Some of it must be for your returning regulars.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266343
    m_Localized: Deunhae
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266344
    m_Localized: There's been less starlight in the village since the Moon Tree withered.
      Fewer alien customers, too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266345
    m_Localized: I always thought the tree made the starlight for us. I haven't known
      what to do either.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266346
    m_Localized: Still, don't be too frightened, dear. Sometimes, even the smallest
      light can awaken a tree again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266347
    m_Localized: Everything in the shop is still where I used to keep it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266348
    m_Localized: Does that arrangement suit you too?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266349
    m_Localized: Next time, tell Grandma what faces your guests make when they taste
      your sweets.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266350
    m_Localized: A little light has returned to the Moon Tree.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266351
    m_Localized: The starlight you brought must be helping. I spent a long time looking
      at it today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266352
    m_Localized: There is no need to rush. Let us keep going, one step at a time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266353
    m_Localized: Once, a customer said their omija tea tasted different from last
      time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266354
    m_Localized: I checked, and the tea was the same. But the treat they were having
      with it was different.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266355
    m_Localized: If things ever become difficult, do not suffer in silence. Come
      and tell Grandma.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266356
    m_Localized: An alien customer from another planet was looking for your tea shop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266357
    m_Localized: They didn't know the treat's name, only its shape. They traced it
      in the air, and even I took a while to recognize it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266358
    m_Localized: The light is still fragile, so let us watch over it and make sure
      it does not go out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266359
    m_Localized: Feel the dough on the days it turns out well, too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266360
    m_Localized: If you only study the batches that go wrong, your hands won't know
      what to aim for.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266361
    m_Localized: Don't just move on because it's good. Remember how today's batch
      feels.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266362
    m_Localized: I'm seeing alien customers linger and talk outside the shop again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266363
    m_Localized: It coincides with the tree's recovery. I keep noticing it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266364
    m_Localized: "(\uD50C\uB808\uC774\uC5B4 \uC774\uB984), this is all your doing."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266365
    m_Localized: We're used to putting treats in the middle and sharing them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266366
    m_Localized: But ask your alien customers whether they intend to share first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266367
    m_Localized: Your shop is growing warmer and kinder than anything Grandma ever
      taught you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266368
    m_Localized: <color=#2F6FDB><b>The Moon Tree used to shine especially brightly
      on days when many alien customers came</b></color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266369
    m_Localized: Back then, I simply thought the bright tree was why there were so
      many visitors.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266370
    m_Localized: Perhaps I will get to see that sight once more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266371
    m_Localized: The way you shape your treats has changed a little.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266372
    m_Localized: It reminded me of when you tried so hard to make them just like
      mine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266373
    m_Localized: That caring heart is what has restored so much of the Moon Tree's
      light. I am very proud of you, dear.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266374
    m_Localized: <color=#2F6FDB><b>On days when alien customers stayed late, the
      tree's glow lingered too</b></color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266375
    m_Localized: At the time, I thought of the starlight they brought and the tree's
      light as separate things.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266376
    m_Localized: The village is regaining its old warmth as well. Your efforts were
      not in vain.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266377
    m_Localized: Your treats have been turning out very consistently lately.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266378
    m_Localized: Do you still remember your checks when the shop gets busy?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266379
    m_Localized: I am so proud to call you my apprentice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266380
    m_Localized: So the Moon Tree <color=#2F6FDB><b>doesn't make starlight. It holds
      the starlight from outside, keeping it here in the village</b></color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266381
    m_Localized: I'm only now beginning to understand it properly myself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266382
    m_Localized: We have come this far because all the feelings you gathered finally
      reached the tree.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266383
    m_Localized: Have a cup of your own tea once the shop is closed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266384
    m_Localized: You may notice an aroma you missed while serving it to customers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266385
    m_Localized: "You have done so wonderfully, (\uD50C\uB808\uC774\uC5B4 \uC774\uB984).
      I could not be prouder."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266386
    m_Localized: <color=#2F6FDB><b>At last, the Moon Tree has regained its glow</b></color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266387
    m_Localized: Seeing the alien customers come and go reminds me of the day you
      took over the shop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266388
    m_Localized: "Thank you, (\uD50C\uB808\uC774\uC5B4 \uC774\uB984). Truly, thank
      you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266389
    m_Localized: Next time, I should sit down in your shop as a customer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266390
    m_Localized: Whenever I've come in, I've gone straight to watching your hands
      at work.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266391
    m_Localized: You have carried on the story Grandma began so beautifully. I am
      very proud of you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266392
    m_Localized: And if you've got something to say, just call me over. I can listen,
      too!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266393
    m_Localized: I'll come see what treats you're serving first!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266394
    m_Localized: I've been trying... But everyone is worried about business. I can't
      just chatter away like nothing's wrong.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266395
    m_Localized: Still, I talked about your shop today. We do have somewhere new
      opening up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266396
    m_Localized: Probably! Next time someone's having trouble choosing, I should
      ask what they like first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266397
    m_Localized: I'll have to stop myself from choosing for them. I can already see
      myself doing it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266398
    m_Localized: It was good! They said it made them excited before the plate even
      arrived.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266399
    m_Localized: You should hear these things, too. You can't hear them yourself
      once the customer has left.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266400
    m_Localized: They'd heard about it, but the route was so confusing they had to
      double back several times. <color=#2F6FDB><b>Apparently Moon Village is harder
      to reach these days</b></color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266401
    m_Localized: What were they looking for?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266402
    m_Localized: A kind of rice cake, but they didn't know its name.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266403
    m_Localized: They described the color and shape with their hands. You might recognize
      it right away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266404
    m_Localized: Yeah. I grumble, but I tell him in the end.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266405
    m_Localized: There are things he won't hear if he spends all his time with his
      notebook.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266406
    m_Localized: But newcomers understand "the tea shop" better. I'll have to get
      used to saying that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266407
    m_Localized: Yes. I told them you're running it now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266408
    m_Localized: And that you're still making the treats Grandma taught you. That's
      worth knowing, isn't it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266409
    m_Localized: They want to know where to look around after they've eaten. Some
      used to rush back because they were worried about the journey.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266410
    m_Localized: Yeah. Even their questions have changed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266411
    m_Localized: They used to ask only about your shop. Now they want to know where
      else to go in Moon Village.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266412
    m_Localized: I could repeat it after them back then. Now I can't read a word.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266413
    m_Localized: Yeah. I unfolded it to throw it away, remembered that day, and put
      it back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266414
    m_Localized: I'm good at throwing things out. Just not bits of paper like this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266415
    m_Localized: It's <color=#2F6FDB><b>a resource that occurs naturally on many
      worlds</b></color>. Buying things isn't its only use, either.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266416
    m_Localized: How do other worlds use it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266417
    m_Localized: The same starlight makes us think of different things.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266418
    m_Localized: They explained, but there were lots of words I didn't know. I'll
      have to ask again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266419
    m_Localized: I wanted to tell everyone about it, but that's no good if I don't
      understand it myself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266420
    m_Localized: On those days I'd just wave from the doorway and leave.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266421
    m_Localized: I didn't ask.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266422
    m_Localized: You'll probably hear things like that running your shop. You don't
      have to pass them on to me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266423
    m_Localized: They remembered me. I spent a while trying to remember where I'd
      seen them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266424
    m_Localized: I think I will. Travel is getting easier now, so we'll probably
      meet again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266425
    m_Localized: I thought it would just be one hello, and that would be that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266426
    m_Localized: I was curious! We were talking about other things, but that detail
      was so clear to him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266427
    m_Localized: He talks a little longer when it's a story like that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266428
    m_Localized: Remember how I complained everyone went straight home? It's the
      other way around now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266429
    m_Localized: I'm glad I opened the shop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266430
    m_Localized: Yeah. People leave your shop, visit another, and come away with
      another story.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266431
    m_Localized: Even I'm busy now. I don't mind being busy like this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266432
    m_Localized: Then let's ask together next time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266433
    m_Localized: Better to hear it yourself than have me leave out the middle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266434
    m_Localized: You know more about the treats than I do, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266435
    m_Localized: Remember the customer who got lost and had to double back several
      times?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266436
    m_Localized: They came again, and it was much easier this time. <color=#2F6FDB><b>They
      said the route looked clearer than before</b></color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266437
    m_Localized: Could it be because the Moon Tree is recovering?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266438
    m_Localized: Maybe they memorized the way to the shop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266439
    m_Localized: That was my first thought, too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266440
    m_Localized: It's curious, hearing things like that since the tree got brighter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266441
    m_Localized: I asked them that!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266442
    m_Localized: But they said it wasn't just near the shop. <color=#2F6FDB><b>The
      route into Moon Village itself was different</b></color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266443
    m_Localized: ...Do tell me how the shop is going, now and then.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266444
    m_Localized: It needs a look before I start.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266445
    m_Localized: Won't take long.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266446
    m_Localized: Yes. Let me know if you'll be late.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266447
    m_Localized: I'll adjust the timing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266448
    m_Localized: You keep them in order.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266449
    m_Localized: Mind your clothes. There's flour on it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266450
    m_Localized: Yes. So Somi can find what she needs at a glance, too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266451
    m_Localized: ...That side is clean.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266452
    m_Localized: Do you miss things sometimes?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266453
    m_Localized: The conversation often carries on as we walk home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266454
    m_Localized: Sometimes. Then I ask again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266455
    m_Localized: Somi can tell if I only pretend to have heard.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266456
    m_Localized: He said it changes a little toward the end.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266457
    m_Localized: The records helped, then.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266458
    m_Localized: Yes. After seeing his notes, I tried taking a break.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266459
    m_Localized: I told Maru to feel the rice cakes himself, too. Some things you
      need to learn with your hands.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266460
    m_Localized: He did a good job.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266461
    m_Localized: Yes. Thanks to him, I can keep using it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266462
    m_Localized: I should lend a hand next time the store needs one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266463
    m_Localized: ...Somi and I both stood still for a moment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266464
    m_Localized: You check them first now, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266465
    m_Localized: Yes. Somi checks the ties. I check the bottom.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266466
    m_Localized: Better not to make the same mistake twice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266467
    m_Localized: You must have closed late.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266468
    m_Localized: A little late.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266469
    m_Localized: But that customer came back. Since then, we keep a few ingredients
      ready even near closing time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266470
    m_Localized: I went back for another look on my way home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266471
    m_Localized: ...The starlight you collected seems to have helped.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266472
    m_Localized: It's brighter than before.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266473
    m_Localized: She's checking whether I'm finished or just resting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266474
    m_Localized: ...Today she saw I was resting and sat beside me for a while.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266475
    m_Localized: A returning alien customer said the mill was just as they remembered.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266476
    m_Localized: I made the rice cakes they remembered.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266477
    m_Localized: I did. She tells me now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266478
    m_Localized: I still find myself looking at the door sometimes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266479
    m_Localized: Oh, I see.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266480
    m_Localized: Hearing the ordinary sounds of someone working in the shop... it
      reassured me for a moment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266481
    m_Localized: I brought my sister to look from the same spot where I'd seen it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266482
    m_Localized: It wasn't just me imagining it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266483
    m_Localized: It's brighter near the tree now... I didn't want to turn back yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266484
    m_Localized: Usually I'm the first to ask to go home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266485
    m_Localized: She said the color underneath was different.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266486
    m_Localized: Now I turn leaves over sometimes, too. There are colors you can't
      see from the front.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266487
    m_Localized: ...I like looking at them this way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266488
    m_Localized: Oh... thank you. My sister said that first, too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266489
    m_Localized: Then she stayed and watched with me. For quite a while.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266490
    m_Localized: I used to think I should find something to say... Now we just sit
      together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266491
    m_Localized: I worry about it less since she told me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266492
    m_Localized: Now I can do my own things while I wait for my sister. The path
      is brighter, and she tells me when she'll be late.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266493
    m_Localized: They said hello first, and I recognized them. We talked a little
      about the treats this time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266494
    m_Localized: I'd like to have tea together next time they come.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266495
    m_Localized: ...Yes. I think we are.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266496
    m_Localized: Next time, I want to recognize them and say hello first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266497
    m_Localized: After that, it felt like my own outfit, rather than one I'd borrowed
      from her.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266498
    m_Localized: Yes. The sleeves wore a little, so we repaired them again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266499
    m_Localized: They're still my most comfortable clothes. I can't throw them away
      yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266500
    m_Localized: Yes. She told me to do just that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266501
    m_Localized: She says it's all right to stop working for me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266502
    m_Localized: I felt bad making him repeat it... but he asked where he'd lost
      me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266503
    m_Localized: Yes. I'll try not to wait so long next time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266504
    m_Localized: The longer he talks, the harder it is to remember where I got lost.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266505
    m_Localized: I felt a little bad on my way out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266506
    m_Localized: That made it feel all right to go back. It would have been harder
      if I'd had to choose that day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266507
    m_Localized: <color=#2F6FDB><b>It was holding the starlight they'd brought</b></color>.
      Now I understand.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266508
    m_Localized: I watched for a moment after they turned the corner... Did they
      find you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266509
    m_Localized: I walk that way all the time, but putting it into words was hard.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266510
    m_Localized: I realized I was only using names I knew.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266511
    m_Localized: I can see the shadows of its branches on the path. I couldn't at
      this hour before.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266512
    m_Localized: Maybe that's why I noticed. My sister says her walk home is brighter,
      too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266513
    m_Localized: Yes. Someone passes, and the shadows disappear for a moment, then
      come back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266514
    m_Localized: I walk slowly beside them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266515
    m_Localized: If there's anything I can look into for you, please let me know.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266516
    m_Localized: I have a few questions myself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266517
    m_Localized: Please tell me when you give it starlight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266518
    m_Localized: You have a shop to run. I'll handle the observations.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266519
    m_Localized: Quite. They are an alien visitor from another planet, after all.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266520
    m_Localized: Next time, I'll ask what they call it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266521
    m_Localized: This change appeared <color=#2F6FDB><b>after you supplied the starlight
      you collected</b></color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266522
    m_Localized: Keep an eye on its progress for me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266523
    m_Localized: Of course.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266524
    m_Localized: A single change isn't necessarily a lasting recovery.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266525
    m_Localized: Flavor alone doesn't give me enough information to compare the results.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266526
    m_Localized: ...I can't entirely deny that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266527
    m_Localized: I'll add a note. 'Ate more because they were delicious.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266528
    m_Localized: I thought you judged the water by eye, but you adjust it after feeling
      the dough.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266529
    m_Localized: I shouldn't simply write 'goes by instinct.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266530
    m_Localized: That's all right. Please show me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266531
    m_Localized: If I compare a good batch with one that isn't ready, I should be
      able to tell the difference.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266532
    m_Localized: ...Does she? I should ask fewer, then.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266533
    m_Localized: Still, I do need to know when she heard it. That question will have
      to stay.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266534
    m_Localized: Once could be a coincidence. But it keeps happening.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266535
    m_Localized: But could some customers have known about the shop and still had
      trouble reaching it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266536
    m_Localized: We can't conclude that yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266537
    m_Localized: First, I'll ask the customers whether their journey here has changed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266538
    m_Localized: I can't deny that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266539
    m_Localized: I added the workers' routes to my notes that day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266540
    m_Localized: But an old record says <color=#2F6FDB><b>the tree shone brighter
      on days when many alien customers visited</b></color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266541
    m_Localized: Could we have been wrong?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266542
    m_Localized: But <color=#2F6FDB><b>if the starlight the customers brought made
      the tree brighter</b></color>, the very same record means something entirely
      different.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266543
    m_Localized: I'm considering that possibility.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266544
    m_Localized: But I shouldn't jump to a conclusion. I'll look further into when
      the starlight arrived, and where it came from.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266545
    m_Localized: What do you do about the gaps?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266546
    m_Localized: I compare other records. If I still can't tell, I leave a blank.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266547
    m_Localized: If I fill it with a guess, I might later mistake it for a fact myself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266548
    m_Localized: Alien customers use it to pay for things, so your shop isn't its
      only way into the village.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266549
    m_Localized: Couldn't the tree be making more?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266550
    m_Localized: If we consider only that explanation, we overlook the starlight
      coming from outside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266551
    m_Localized: I'll examine the amount arriving and the time it stays separately.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266552
    m_Localized: The Moon Tree <color=#2F6FDB><b>doesn't produce starlight. It holds
      the starlight that comes from outside, allowing it to remain stable here in
      Moon Village</b></color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266553
    m_Localized: Alien customers come for the treats and bring starlight. <color=#2F6FDB><b>That
      starlight helps the tree recover, allowing more customers to visit</b></color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266554
    m_Localized: <color=#2F6FDB><b>Your shop set that cycle in motion again</b></color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266555
    m_Localized: The idea that the tree produces starlight was wrong. But <color=#2F6FDB><b>selling
      treats to collect starlight and help the tree was the right decision</b></color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266556
    m_Localized: The recovering tree <color=#2F6FDB><b>keeps starlight in the village
      and stabilizes the connection to other planets</b></color>, making it easier
      for alien customers to reach us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266557
    m_Localized: If you hadn't started collecting starlight, none of this would have
      begun again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266558
    m_Localized: I've revised my first description of it too. The part that said
      it 'produces starlight.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266559
    m_Localized: Thank you for helping me figure it out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266560
    m_Localized: ...Even an incorrect record can be useful.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266561
    m_Localized: Thank you as well.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266562
    m_Localized: Without your shop and the starlight you collected, I couldn't have
      worked it out from the records alone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266563
    m_Localized: For once, I should choose what I want to eat, rather than what I
      want to record.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266564
    m_Localized: ...I should reread my earliest notes. I've put <color=#2F6FDB><b>cause
      and effect the wrong way round</b></color> in places.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266565
    m_Localized: So the weakening tree meant fewer customers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266566
    m_Localized: Can we find out why it first withered?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266567
    m_Localized: Yes. <color=#2F6FDB><b>The unstable route meant fewer alien customers,
      so less starlight arrived and the tree weakened further</b></color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266568
    m_Localized: Now the process is moving in the other direction, toward recovery.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266569
    m_Localized: <color=#2F6FDB><b>We still don't know how it began</b></color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266570
    m_Localized: We can explain why it grew weaker afterward and why it's recovering
      now. But the original cause needs its own investigation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266571
    m_Localized: Several alien customers have mentioned the journey to Moon Village.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266572
    m_Localized: They knew the way. Yet <color=#2F6FDB><b>even on a familiar route,
      they said things began to feel hazy partway through</b></color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266573
    m_Localized: Did that start after the Moon Tree withered?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266574
    m_Localized: Could they simply have taken a wrong turn?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266575
    m_Localized: The timing is similar.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266576
    m_Localized: We can't say the tree caused it yet, but it's worth recording.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266577
    m_Localized: If it were one first-time visitor, I might have thought so too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266578
    m_Localized: But customers who have visited Moon Village for years reported the
      same thing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266579
    m_Localized: I checked when the customers first noticed the route becoming clearer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266580
    m_Localized: It was <color=#2F6FDB><b>after the Moon Tree began to show a significant
      recovery</b></color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266581
    m_Localized: Does that mean the tree and the route are connected?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266582
    m_Localized: Could the customers just be getting used to the route?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266583
    m_Localized: It makes that more likely.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266584
    m_Localized: But we still don't know exactly how the two are connected.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266585
    m_Localized: I considered that possibility too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266586
    m_Localized: But customers who have been visiting Moon Village for years noticed
      the same change.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266587
    m_Localized: I've been staring at it so long I can't tell if the length is right.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266588
    m_Localized: I intend to. There's no point if it only fits when you're standing
      still.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266589
    m_Localized: The customer won't spend all day doing that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266590
    m_Localized: The leaves must have dulled that much.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266591
    m_Localized: It does. Fewer customers, familiar colors changing...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266592
    m_Localized: But I'm not about to let my window display go dull too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266593
    m_Localized: Yes. But that's better than being annoyed by it all day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266594
    m_Localized: I can work out the look again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266595
    m_Localized: Those two work so quickly together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266596
    m_Localized: I'd have to learn to explain quite a lot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266597
    m_Localized: True. I doubt they were that coordinated from the start.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266598
    m_Localized: I imagine Somi would have plenty to say about it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266599
    m_Localized: Once they showed me, I could see what needed altering.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266600
    m_Localized: If I can't, I need to say so first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266601
    m_Localized: I can't promise one thing and hand over something else later. It's
      my work.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266602
    m_Localized: They got in the way when she worked the dough.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266603
    m_Localized: There was still plenty of wear in it with a few repairs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266604
    m_Localized: Helping someone keep a well-fitting garment is part of my job too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266605
    m_Localized: Yes. Lately, I'm thinking about how to show things off, not just
      keep them tidy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266606
    m_Localized: I'm enjoying having a display to plan again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266607
    m_Localized: I even moved around to check it wasn't just the angle of the light.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266608
    m_Localized: The starlight you collected must have helped. It's good to see.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266609
    m_Localized: Which would you choose? Something subtle outside with a bright lining,
      or something bold at first glance?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266610
    m_Localized: A slightly different look when you stand still and when you walk.
      Hehe, it's starting to come together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266611
    m_Localized: Really? I thought you'd choose the lining.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266612
    m_Localized: Then I'd keep the inside quieter to balance that bold exterior.
      If everything stands out, nothing does.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266613
    m_Localized: I think she knows I stayed up making them and doesn't want to say
      she dislikes anything.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266614
    m_Localized: Tell her you want an honest answer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266615
    m_Localized: When I asked whether it was uncomfortable, she nodded.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266616
    m_Localized: I did. I told her it's better to tell me while I can still change
      it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266617
    m_Localized: Then she pointed out something else. I think she's getting more
      comfortable with it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266618
    m_Localized: I liked it outside, but back in the workroom the color wasn't quite
      what I'd pictured.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266619
    m_Localized: Which version did you like better?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266620
    m_Localized: The way it looked outside. That's why I can't put it away yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266621
    m_Localized: I need to see it alongside a few other fabrics.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266622
    m_Localized: I started telling her where to move it, but I spoke too soon. She
      already had an idea.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266623
    m_Localized: I only helped with how she held the needle. She was more careful
      than I expected.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266624
    m_Localized: A little. But if I did it for her, she wouldn't get to try.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266625
    m_Localized: I told her to call me if she needed anything.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266626
    m_Localized: They got lost less this time. <color=#2F6FDB><b>As the tree recovers,
      the connection to other planets is becoming more stable</b></color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266627
    m_Localized: They must have liked your clothes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266628
    m_Localized: Now we can discuss what I'll have ready for them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266629
    m_Localized: I hope so.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266630
    m_Localized: When they come back, I'll start by showing them the changes they
      asked for.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266631
    m_Localized: I only noticed after I thought it was finished. I couldn't bear
      to look at it for a while.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266632
    m_Localized: Do you still make mistakes?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266633
    m_Localized: It took ages to unpick. On the next outfit, I checked the sleeves
      first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266634
    m_Localized: Certainly. I just try to catch them before they leave the shop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266635
    m_Localized: Pretending not to see it won't make a sleeve fit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266636
    m_Localized: I can finally hold that fabric beside it again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266637
    m_Localized: You worked hard too, Bori.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266638
    m_Localized: So did you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266639
    m_Localized: I have orders waiting from returning alien customers. It's time
      to give those my attention.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266640
    m_Localized: I should ask Nuri to come for a walk. She notices different things.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266641
    m_Localized: Exactly. I'm thinking about that too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266642
    m_Localized: I want the clothes to feel like Moon Village, but still be easy
      to wear. I'd like both my style and my shop to last.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266643
    m_Localized: After Nuri finished, she tried it on for me and asked me to tell
      her what felt awkward.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266644
    m_Localized: That's what you always tell her.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266645
    m_Localized: You could make clothes together now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266646
    m_Localized: Exactly. She remembered what I said.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266647
    m_Localized: Now I owe her a proper answer too. She can't improve it if all I
      say is 'well done.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266648
    m_Localized: Hehe, I'd have to ask her first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266649
    m_Localized: Fixing one pocket doesn't necessarily mean she wants to help with
      her sister's work. But if she'd like to try, there's room beside me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266650
    m_Localized: I'll let Garam know too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266651
    m_Localized: If you get stuck with the shop, say something. Don't sit there worrying
      on your own.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266652
    m_Localized: We haven't had many alien customers lately. I've still got ingredients
      ready, though. I can't have someone come all this way for nothing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266653
    m_Localized: Garam is still working.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266654
    m_Localized: Yes. Less to make doesn't mean there's nothing to do.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266655
    m_Localized: I'd better check the ledger again myself. I nearly forgot while
      we were chatting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266656
    m_Localized: Quiet doesn't mean we've gone home, mind you. We might just be eating
      inside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266657
    m_Localized: A few repeat customers have heard it and said, 'This must be the
      place.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266658
    m_Localized: I wonder if they remember the sound back on their own planets. I
      hear it every day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266659
    m_Localized: I water them when he can't.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266660
    m_Localized: I can't leave him to do all the caring. I look at them every day
      now too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266661
    m_Localized: It's food. We can't be careless.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266662
    m_Localized: But I have honey with the second piece. I need to check that flavor
      too. And I happen to like it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266663
    m_Localized: Garam hesitates because he feels bad asking. I just ask if it's
      possible.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266664
    m_Localized: And you help his shop next time?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266665
    m_Localized: Of course! If he's short of hands, we go over.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266666
    m_Localized: You should speak up too if you can't manage something alone. We
      need to hear about it before we can help you think it through.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266667
    m_Localized: I knew he was watching, but the sacks couldn't get past him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266668
    m_Localized: He did ask him to move. But that doesn't tell you where to go.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266669
    m_Localized: Next time, Maru asked where we'd be moving things before he settled
      in.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266670
    m_Localized: Half a day, at least. The flour kept coming out of every little
      gap.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266671
    m_Localized: After that, neither of us ever gave a sack just a passing glance
      again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266672
    m_Localized: Delighted! When they came back, the first thing they asked for was
      the rice cake they'd had that day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266673
    m_Localized: Since then, we've got into the habit of keeping a few ingredients
      aside near closing time. Just in case.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266674
    m_Localized: It must be tiring to finish late.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266675
    m_Localized: It is. But I don't mind staying late to check orders again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266676
    m_Localized: It's much better than watching the clock with no customers at all.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266677
    m_Localized: I'll stop and have a look this evening too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266678
    m_Localized: Are your old regulars coming back too?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266679
    m_Localized: Yes. They said <color=#2F6FDB><b>the route had been too difficult
      for a while</b></color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266680
    m_Localized: They were worried we'd closed down. And I'd been wondering if they'd
      forgotten us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266681
    m_Localized: One asked for more this time. They had more people to share it with.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266682
    m_Localized: Now I check the quantity twice. I have to pass it on to Garam, too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266683
    m_Localized: Then she'd say straight away, 'I'll need to adjust the water today.'
      You do that too, don't you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266684
    m_Localized: We prepare them, and you give them another check. That's how it
      should be.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266685
    m_Localized: I liked that she knew what she wanted.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266686
    m_Localized: Just saying something isn't good doesn't help me fix it. She always
      told me exactly what needed changing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266687
    m_Localized: At least you have that walk together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266688
    m_Localized: We need that time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266689
    m_Localized: If we've worked together all day, we should at least have the walk
      home without talking about work.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266690
    m_Localized: They'll be able to visit more often now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266691
    m_Localized: Yes. The route is stable again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266692
    m_Localized: They came for your treats and stopped by here too. Thank you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266693
    m_Localized: Every time I see you, I start by asking how much you need today.
      Let's talk about something else for once!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266694
    m_Localized: We see each other every day, yet somehow there's never time to sit
      and talk.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266695
    m_Localized: If we've finished tidying up too, certainly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266696
    m_Localized: If it's a busy day, we can make it another time. Leave the ledger
      behind and just come as you are.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266697
    m_Localized: Try things out and tell me whether the supplies I kept for her will
      suit you too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266698
    m_Localized: Start with what's most urgent. I'll help you find what you need.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266699
    m_Localized: Do you go outside for a break?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266700
    m_Localized: Ho ho, of course. I ought to see what's happening in the village.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266701
    m_Localized: Stay inside the shop all day, and every bit of news has to come
      through a customer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266702
    m_Localized: Ask her if it worries you. No need to tiptoe around and take the
      long way past everything.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266703
    m_Localized: You could have a look at the small things.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266704
    m_Localized: Get help with the harder jobs. I don't insist on doing what I can't
      manage, either.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266705
    m_Localized: My hands were a little slow to learn the shop had changed hands.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266706
    m_Localized: I'm sure she does.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266707
    m_Localized: Still, it seems she's stepping back so you can try things for yourself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266708
    m_Localized: She used to step in sometimes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266709
    m_Localized: Lately, she waits for Nuri to decide. Even her questions have changed
      a little.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266710
    m_Localized: No one bought anything. That isn't quite the same as no one coming.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266711
    m_Localized: Trade is picking up again now, and the light around the tree lingers
      longer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266712
    m_Localized: They said they couldn't stop thinking about it after they went home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266713
    m_Localized: You remembered them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266714
    m_Localized: I remembered how long they'd looked at it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266715
    m_Localized: And that they'd left without buying it that day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266716
    m_Localized: The starlight you've collected must be helping.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266717
    m_Localized: It made me think of customers who might return. I hadn't let myself
      think that way for a while.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266718
    m_Localized: Some bring it to me, saying there's still use in it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266719
    m_Localized: Even a short piece has its uses.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266720
    m_Localized: Bori's ends are neatly trimmed. Somi winds hers in big loops that
      are easy to undo.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266721
    m_Localized: A hand leaves its habits behind, even without a name.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266722
    m_Localized: They said <color=#2F6FDB><b>the unstable route to Moon Village had
      kept them away</b></color>. I'd wondered if they no longer liked my goods.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266723
    m_Localized: Knowing we were here hadn't meant they could reach us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266724
    m_Localized: Indeed. I was left with my own guesses.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266725
    m_Localized: It was good to be able to ask them directly this time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266726
    m_Localized: That was when I cleared some space. I'd made it look inviting, then
      left no room for anyone's hands.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266727
    m_Localized: Sometimes. But I try not to move a regular's usual things too often.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266728
    m_Localized: When they come in and head for a familiar spot, I tend to let them
      look before speaking.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266729
    m_Localized: They say it's pleasant to linger now it's brighter near the Moon
      Tree.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266730
    m_Localized: Do you enjoy that time?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266731
    m_Localized: I don't have to keep the shop open just to hear their stories.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266732
    m_Localized: I do. People talk about different things when they aren't choosing
      what to buy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266733
    m_Localized: Where they went today, that sort of thing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266734
    m_Localized: I thought I was simply taking payment. But those trades were connected
      to the tree too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266735
    m_Localized: I hope the customers keep coming back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266736
    m_Localized: So do I. I'd better have something worth choosing when they return.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266737
    m_Localized: An easier journey won't run the business for me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266738
    m_Localized: A returning alien customer was pleased to find my shop in the same
      place.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266739
    m_Localized: I intend to keep my shop open too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266740
    m_Localized: Good.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266741
    m_Localized: Customers coming for your treats have stopped here too. I owe you
      a word of thanks for that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266742
    m_Localized: It's good not to spend all my time deciding what to order less of.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266743
    m_Localized: I'll come and have a look.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266744
    m_Localized: Finding room for both has me thinking about the shelves again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266745
    m_Localized: Please do. You needn't have something to buy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266746
    m_Localized: I'll try to make time for a cup of tea.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266747
    m_Localized: An alien regular of many years said the journey here was easier
      this time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266748
    m_Localized: <color=#2F6FDB><b>They know the route well, yet for a while they
      kept feeling their sense of direction grow hazy</b></color> along the way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266749
    m_Localized: Could that be because the Moon Tree has recovered?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266750
    m_Localized: Did that happen in the past too?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266751
    m_Localized: That crossed my mind as well.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266752
    m_Localized: I should pass it on to Maru. These accounts are best considered
      together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266753
    m_Localized: I hardly remember hearing such things before the tree withered.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266754
    m_Localized: It's curious that people have stopped saying it again lately.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266755
    m_Localized: Why did it start withering?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266756
    m_Localized: Do you think I can do this?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266757
    m_Localized: We don't know yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266758
    m_Localized: But when you said you'd <color=#2F6FDB><b>sell treats and use the
      starlight to help the tree</b></color>, I felt we finally had something to
      try.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266759
    m_Localized: Put what you've learned into practice, one thing at a time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266760
    m_Localized: And ask me when you get stuck. You don't have to know everything
      on your own from the start.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266761
    m_Localized: I'm a little hesitant to change it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266762
    m_Localized: For now, I'm keeping things where I know them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266763
    m_Localized: I left you the shop to use, dear. Of course you may change it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266764
    m_Localized: Start with whatever you keep having to walk around.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266765
    m_Localized: Then change things when you find something awkward.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266766
    m_Localized: I didn't find the right place for everything on my first day either.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266767
    m_Localized: What a relief.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266768
    m_Localized: Yes. Today, I found myself looking for what had improved, instead
      of worrying it would wither further.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266769
    m_Localized: Take your time and have a look too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266770
    m_Localized: Could that have changed the taste?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266771
    m_Localized: Did you serve them something else?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266772
    m_Localized: Perhaps. Or perhaps their taste was different that day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266773
    m_Localized: Rather than simply saying it was the same tea, I asked what flavor
      they'd been expecting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266774
    m_Localized: After hearing them out, I paired it with a different treat next
      time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266775
    m_Localized: After that, they started asking for that pairing themselves.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266776
    m_Localized: So that's how some customers find us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266777
    m_Localized: It happened in my day too. Some described the color, or asked first
      for the tea they'd had with it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266778
    m_Localized: I'm sure they'll recognize it when they see what you've made.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266779
    m_Localized: Could the two be connected?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266780
    m_Localized: It could be word about the shop spreading.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266781
    m_Localized: We don't know yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266782
    m_Localized: Ask the customers about their journey. They may have something to
      tell us that we couldn't see from here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266783
    m_Localized: That must be part of it. They came because they wanted your treats.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266784
    m_Localized: But I hadn't considered whether some heard about the shop and still
      couldn't come.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266785
    m_Localized: They might want separate servings.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266786
    m_Localized: Yes. Arriving together doesn't mean they'll eat the same things.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266787
    m_Localized: Ask first, and you'll have fewer plates to rearrange afterward.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266788
    m_Localized: Could it have been the other way around?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266789
    m_Localized: Didn't it seem strange at the time?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266790
    m_Localized: We'll need to look into that further.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266791
    m_Localized: I remember seeing the two together. That doesn't mean I know which
      came first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266792
    m_Localized: It had always been that way, so I never asked why.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266793
    m_Localized: Seeing something for years isn't the same as understanding it, is
      it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266794
    m_Localized: Are they all right this way?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266795
    m_Localized: I'd like to see you make some again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266796
    m_Localized: They're easy to eat. And the shape seems comfortable in your hands
      now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266797
    m_Localized: Then keep making them that way. They needn't be exactly like mine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266798
    m_Localized: Now that you're running the shop, we have less time to make things
      together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266799
    m_Localized: Let's sit side by side when we can. I'd like to see what you've
      changed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266800
    m_Localized: I've been seeing that lately too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266801
    m_Localized: Yes. The old ledgers might help us understand more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266802
    m_Localized: There are many days I can't recall from memory alone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266803
    m_Localized: Sometimes I start to rush.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266804
    m_Localized: Was it hard for you too?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266805
    m_Localized: When that happens, take a moment to check, even if it means a little
      delay.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266806
    m_Localized: Asking customers to wait was something I had to learn too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266807
    m_Localized: Of course. With customers waiting, I always felt I could manage
      just a little more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266808
    m_Localized: Some days, fixing what I'd missed made everything take longer in
      the end.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266809
    m_Localized: The tree was keeping the customers' route connected too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266810
    m_Localized: Your shop must have been part of it as well.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266811
    m_Localized: Yes. <color=#2F6FDB><b>The recovering tree steadies the connection
      to other planets</b></color>, and the alien customers who visit bring more
      starlight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266812
    m_Localized: <color=#2F6FDB><b>Your shop set that flow in motion again</b></color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266813
    m_Localized: It must have been.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266814
    m_Localized: All those days of serving treats and receiving starlight were connected
      to the tree. It makes me see my everyday work differently.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266815
    m_Localized: I feel like I should tidy up first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266816
    m_Localized: You can finish what needs finishing, then have your tea.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266817
    m_Localized: Just don't reach for tomorrow's worries the moment today's work
      is done.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266818
    m_Localized: Did you know it would turn out this way?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266819
    m_Localized: Everyone helped me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266820
    m_Localized: I couldn't have known all this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266821
    m_Localized: But I believed you when you said you would try. Everything since
      then, you've built one customer at a time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266822
    m_Localized: Yes. The mill and the shop kept doing their part.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266823
    m_Localized: And you've worked very hard, dear. Let's stay and look at the tree
      a little longer today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266824
    m_Localized: I might feel like I'm being tested again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266825
    m_Localized: I'll have a plate ready for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266826
    m_Localized: Is that how it felt? Then I won't talk about your methods unless
      you ask.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266827
    m_Localized: Just tell me which tea would go well with the treats.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266828
    m_Localized: Thank you. Nothing too special, mind.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266829
    m_Localized: I'd like to try the treats you serve your customers every day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266830
    m_Localized: The Moon Tree
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266831
    m_Localized: Everyday life
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
